{# ============================================================================
   HADIYA · Luxe · جملة البراند  (lx-story)
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
   │▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓ photograph, full bleed ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓│
   │▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓      ── فن الإهداء ──     ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓│
   │▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓   «الهدية مش في اللي جوّه العلبة،  ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓│
   │▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓   الهدية في إنك افتكرت.»        ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓│
   │▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓      اكتشف المجموعة →      ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓│
   └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
   One sentence, set large, over a dark photograph — the brand speaking
   between two product sections. The photo is darkened by an overlay so the
   statement reads at AA on any upload, and drifts slowly on scroll (CSS only,
   off for prefers-reduced-motion).

   Styling: assets/theme.css → "LUXE · lx-story".
   ========================================================================= #}

{% set id = widget.id %}
{% set d = widget.data %}
{% macro mediaUrl(m) %}{% if m %}{% if m is string %}{{ m }}{% elif m.fileUrl %}{{ m.fileUrl }}{% elif m.url %}{{ m.url }}{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endmacro %}
{% set img = mediaUrl(d.image) | trim %}
{% set img = img if (img | length) else ('slot-story.jpg' | assets) %}

<section id="lx-story-{{ id }}" class="lx-story" aria-labelledby="lx-story-t-{{ id }}">
  <img class="lx-story-bg" src="{{ img }}" alt="" loading="lazy"/>
  <div class="lx-story-copy">
    {% if d.eyebrow %}<p class="lx-eyebrow lx-eyebrow--center">{{ d.eyebrow }}</p>{% endif %}
    <p id="lx-story-t-{{ id }}" class="lx-story-quote">{{ d.title }}</p>
    {% if d.text %}<div class="lx-story-text">{{ d.text | safe }}</div>{% endif %}
    {% if d.link_text %}
      <a class="lx-link" href="{{ d.link_url | default('/shop', true) }}">{{ d.link_text }}
        <svg class="rtl-flip" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #lx-story-{{ id }} { --lx-story-h: {{ d.height | default(620) }}px; }
</style>

{% ui "section-colors.njk", scope='#lx-story-' ~ id, c=d %}
